{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳照片，顯示東涌一間酒樓內有一名男子在室內吸煙，無視現場其他食客，期間亦未見酒樓員工上前阻止，事件引發網絡熱議。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"760587631_10238962809040197_4872767979438866827_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TGVx1BAAUk1786003820.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"760587631_10238962809040197_4872767979438866827_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">發帖網民在社交平台分享了兩張照片，顯示涉事男子在酒樓內吸煙，該網民發文嘲諷對方為「超級VIP熟客」，並寫道：「好日唔嚟呢度飲茶，原來有 VIP 專利，啲伙記同佢有傾有講，睇住佢食都唔理，真係高人一等……」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"762689097_10238962808880193_1513302227535275376_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026FLr5xANdxH1786003829.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"762689097_10238962808880193_1513302227535275376_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">貼文隨即引發網絡熱議，有網民表示對此情況早已「見慣不怪」，指涉事酒樓過往亦曾有類似情況，坦言：「不嬲都有，以前報過控煙辦，隔幾日先去，邊有人捉到」、「成日都有人一路飲茶一路食煙，多數都係老人家」此外，亦有網民透露曾因相關情況，而選擇不再光顧：「對上嗰次係 6 年前咁上下，就係不滿啲阿姐畀人嚟呢度食煙，投訴完都冇理我」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T08:20:44.752805+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}